"Sets the mix target. On surround output, "
":ref:`MIX_TARGET_STEREO<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_STEREO>` routes to the "
"front left/right speakers, "
":ref:`MIX_TARGET_SURROUND<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_SURROUND>` routes to "
"all speaker positions, and "
":ref:`MIX_TARGET_CENTER<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_CENTER>` routes to "
"center/LFE."
msgstr ""
"设置混音目标。环绕输出下，   :ref:`MIX_TARGET_STEREO<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_STEREO>`"
"    路由到前置左右扬声器，   "
":ref:`MIX_TARGET_SURROUND<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_SURROUND>`    "
"路由到所有扬声器位置，   :ref:`MIX_TARGET_CENTER<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_CENTER>`"
"    路由到中置和 LFE。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:600 d2f670f56b2949bfa67efe1c90c0e00f
