msgid "The default value is ``&\"Master\"``."
msgstr "默认值为  ``&\"Master\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:21 63656de04fdd4df4a493047216a75bd1
msgid ""
"Plays :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` resources through FMOD with volume in "
"decibels, a pitch multiplier, playback controls, speaker mix targets, and bus routing."
msgstr "通过 FMOD 播放  :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` \\ ，支持分贝音量、音调倍率、播放控制、扬声器混音目标和总线路由。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:122 4cfffc7091c94893955c1538632f164c
msgid ""
"Emitted when the playback channel ends. Calling "
":ref:`stop()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_stop>` or replacing "
":ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_stream>` does not emit this signal."
msgstr ""
"播放通道结束时发出。调用  :ref:`stop()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_stop>`  或替换  "
":ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_stream>`  不会发出此信号。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:285 c1443d5f87c64655b7a6345c4a1d66c0
msgid "If ``true``, defers playback until the node is ready, outside the editor."
msgstr "为  ``true``  时，在节点就绪后延迟开始播放，在编辑器中不生效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:336 eddad39a526946fc89488f46c12e05e8
msgid ""
"Stops the current playback and assigns ``stream``. Playback must be started again with "
":ref:`play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_play>`."
msgstr "停止当前播放并设置  ``stream`` \\ ，之后需调用  :ref:`play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_play>`  开始播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:362 89c50001082f4c4ab90861e32870f16c
msgid ""
"Preloads the assigned stream by creating its internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`. "
"Returns ``false`` if no stream is assigned or sound creation fails."
msgstr "通过创建内部  :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`  预加载音频流。未设置音频流或声音创建失败时返回  ``false`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:374 bacddfbcf073402891b13786c57cd4c9
msgid "Starts or restarts playback at ``from_position``, in seconds. Use a nonnegative position."
msgstr "从  ``from_position``  指定的位置开始或重新播放，单位为秒。位置应为非负数。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:426 6fd3c776648b4f06ae8f508c9cb8459d
msgid "Returns ``true`` while a playback channel is active, including while paused."
msgstr "播放通道处于活动状态时返回  ``true`` \\ ，暂停时也返回  ``true`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:462 29d02aa6d9ee47978d86e370bf8ec684
msgid ""
"Returns the playback position in seconds, including while paused. Returns ``0.0`` if there is"
" no valid playback channel."
msgstr "返回播放位置，单位为秒，暂停时仍可查询。没有有效播放通道时返回  ``0.0`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:554 e60c38ecf00e46749293d68e9c10e3a2
msgid ""
"Sets :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_auto_play>`. Automatic playback is "
"deferred until the node is ready and is disabled in the editor."
msgstr ""
"设置  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_auto_play>` \\ "
"。自动播放会延迟到节点就绪后执行，在编辑器中不生效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:566 810c1ab76e1c41d8ac689f1bf1d56f36
msgid "Returns whether :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_auto_play>` is enabled."
msgstr "返回是否启用了  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_property_auto_play>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:602 eeb30610bd434ab0b43330c4073dad11
msgid ""
"Selects the bus used when the next playback channel is created. Changing this value does not "
"reroute an existing channel."
msgstr "设置下次创建播放通道时使用的总线。修改此值不会改变现有通道的路由。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer.rst:604 70f88a78b4ce4392b2a4701dc8c32937
msgid ""
"If the bus is not found in :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`, playback uses"
" the master channel group."
msgstr "在  :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`  中找不到该总线时，播放使用主通道组。"
